        ("PR NEWSWIRE · SAZERAC · 2 NOV", "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/svedka-vodka-is-challenging-fans-to-create-its-next-super-bowl-commercial-for-a-chance-to-win-500k-302926383.html"),
